@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Người nộp tiền" as Payer
actor "Email provider" as Mail
rectangle "Phân hệ đóng học phí iBanking" {
  usecase "Đăng nhập" as Login
  usecase "Xem hồ sơ và số dư" as Profile
  usecase "Tra cứu học phí" as Lookup
  usecase "Tạo giao dịch" as Create
  usecase "Xác thực OTP" as OTP
  usecase "Xem kết quả/lịch sử" as History
  usecase "Gửi OTP/email xác nhận" as Email
}
Payer --> Login
Payer --> Profile
Payer --> Lookup
Payer --> Create
Payer --> OTP
Payer --> History
Create .> Lookup : <<include>>
OTP .> Create : <<extend>>
Create .> Email : <<include>>
OTP .> Email : <<include>>
Mail --> Email
@enduml
